On her resume, it shows her height and her weight, which I just want to say, I can't believe I used to weigh that.

949
00:44:40.050 --> 00:44:43.430
Oh, because they matched her height and weight to you?

950
00:44:43.510 --> 00:44:43.730
Yes.

951
00:44:43.730 --> 00:44:48.990
When they find you a body double or a stunt double, they have to match the person's height, the weight, the general hair color,

952
00:44:49.010 --> 00:44:52.130
or they'll put a wig on the person or color that person's hair.

953
00:44:52.270 --> 00:44:57.230
But it's more than that because I was on this one movie, and they had to get a body double for me.

954
00:44:57.670 --> 00:45:00.370
And the woman showed up, and she was my height and weight.

955
00:45:00.390 --> 00:45:04.350
But her, like, weight distribution was totally different from mine.

956
00:45:04.630 --> 00:45:05.950
So walking and…

957
00:45:05.950 --> 00:45:06.870
She didn't look like me.

958
00:45:06.870 --> 00:45:07.550
She didn't look like you.

959
00:45:07.710 --> 00:45:08.790
This happened to me, Jenna.

960
00:45:09.210 --> 00:45:11.350
I did a movie called Struck by Lightning.

961
00:45:11.630 --> 00:45:18.270
And there was this long tracking dolly scene that started in a room and ended up on the sofa that I was sitting on.

962
00:45:18.390 --> 00:45:18.570
Okay.

963
00:45:19.210 --> 00:45:27.430
And they had a body double for me for all the lighting set up because it was going to take a really long time to get this set up.

964
00:45:28.630 --> 00:45:34.590
So after an hour of them setting this all up, using the body double, it's time for me to report on set.

965
00:45:34.750 --> 00:45:37.490
We do this long, intricate tracking shot.

966
00:45:37.610 --> 00:45:38.650
The camera's coming down.

967
00:45:38.830 --> 00:45:43.590
This long track lands on me on the sofa, and it cuts part of my head off.

968
00:45:43.810 --> 00:45:46.870
Well, what they found out was she was my exact height.

969
00:45:47.070 --> 00:45:52.050
They immediately called for her because the director of photography had set up all this time for the shot.

970
00:45:52.190 --> 00:45:53.690
And he said, are you 5'1"?

971
00:45:53.690 --> 00:45:54.450
And she said, yes.

972
00:45:54.550 --> 00:45:55.830
And she came and stood next to me.

973
00:45:55.830 --> 00:45:56.990
We were the same height.

974
00:45:57.150 --> 00:45:59.070
And then he said, sit side by side.

975
00:45:59.270 --> 00:46:00.730
We sat side by side.

976
00:46:00.930 --> 00:46:02.950
I had a longer torso than she did.

977
00:46:03.170 --> 00:46:03.650
Yes!

978
00:46:03.970 --> 00:46:05.350
This is what I'm saying.

979
00:46:05.690 --> 00:46:07.890
So they had to, like, measure her.

980
00:46:07.990 --> 00:46:09.630
Like, did we have the same waist?

981
00:46:09.630 --> 00:46:12.090
The circumference of your thigh.

982
00:46:12.370 --> 00:46:13.470
Like, all of that.

983
00:46:13.690 --> 00:46:17.930
And Nancy McCrum was just an exact body double for me.

984
00:46:18.090 --> 00:46:22.070
Well, I could never tell that there was a body double there, so they did a great job.

985
00:46:22.190 --> 00:46:23.470
Well, here's what I did.

986
00:46:23.470 --> 00:46:30.050
She was also very good at volleyball, and she taught me how to do the motion, how to jump

987
00:46:30.050 --> 00:46:31.890
up, how to serve it, and all of that.

988
00:46:32.030 --> 00:46:37.470
And I did a whole, whole bunch of takes, and we used a CGI ball.

989
00:46:37.470 --> 00:46:40.010
So that you didn't have to actually make the contact.

990
00:46:40.370 --> 00:46:40.610
Yeah.

991
00:46:41.170 --> 00:46:47.210
Randy reminded me that the very first time I tried to do it by making contact with the

992
00:46:47.210 --> 00:46:48.970
ball, and I, like, winced in pain.

993
00:46:48.970 --> 00:46:50.830
And he was like, no, no, no more ball.

994
00:46:50.910 --> 00:46:52.070
We're never having her do that again.

